# Admin Panel API Tests
# First, start your Strapi server with: npm run develop

### 1. Admin Login
POST http://localhost:1337/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin@serpbays.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Store the JWT token from the login response and use it in subsequent requests
@token = {{LOGIN_RESPONSE.jwt}}

### 2. Get Admin Dashboard Stats
GET http://localhost:1337/api/admin/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get Admin User Info
GET http://localhost:1337/api/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get Recent Activities
GET http://localhost:1337/api/admin/dashboard/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get Users List
GET http://localhost:1337/api/admin/users?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get User Statistics
GET http://localhost:1337/api/admin/users/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Get Specific User Details
GET http://localhost:1337/api/admin/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Update User Status (Block/Unblock)
PUT http://localhost:1337/api/admin/users/1/block
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "blocked": false
}

### 9. Get Orders List
GET http://localhost:1337/api/admin/orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Get Order Statistics
GET http://localhost:1337/api/admin/orders/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Get Transactions List
GET http://localhost:1337/api/admin/transactions?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Get Transaction Statistics
GET http://localhost:1337/api/admin/transactions/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Get Withdrawals List
GET http://localhost:1337/api/admin/withdrawals?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

